    {
      "number": 3,
      "id": "I_kwDOQHxa487ViDmD",
      "title": "Deterministic vs randomized",
      "url": "https://github.com/lamps-wg/cms-fn-dsa/issues/3",
      "state": "CLOSED",
      "author": "danvangeest",
      "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
      "assignees": [
        "danvangeest"
      ],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "FN-DSA doesn't have deterministic and randomized/hedged variants because the deterministic variant was very insecure against side-channel attacks.  Fix text referring to these differences.",
      "createdAt": "2025-11-03T15:05:50Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-11-04T13:34:20Z",
      "closedAt": "2025-11-04T13:34:20Z",
      "comments": []
    },
    {
      "number": 4,
      "id": "I_kwDOQHxa487ViE8p",
      "title": "FN-DSA as an alternative to SLH-DSA",
      "url": "https://github.com/lamps-wg/cms-fn-dsa/issues/4",
      "state": "OPEN",
      "author": "danvangeest",
      "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
      "assignees": [],
      "labels": [],
      "body": "This draft was copied from the ML-DSA one.  In the intro, FN-DSA is listed an an alternative to SLH-DSA.  This is an artifact from the ML-DSA document.  If anything, we should list FN-DSA an an alternative to ML-DSA and specify the tradeoffs.",
      "createdAt": "2025-11-03T15:07:30Z",
      "updatedAt": "2025-11-03T15:13:59Z",
      "closedAt": null,
      "comments": [
        {
          "author": "danvangeest",
          "authorAssociation": "COLLABORATOR",
          "body": "Section 3.2 also compares FN-DSA to SLH-DSA, is this appropriate or should it compare to ML-DSA or both?",
          "createdAt": "2025-11-03T15:13:59Z",
          "updatedAt": "2025-11-03T15:13:59Z"
        }
      ]
    }
